      "parameters": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 350,
        "content": "## Scenario 1 · 192.168.5.151 preconfigured\nEditor: http://192.168.5.151:5678\nAudio API: http://192.168.5.151:8081\nLLM: http://192.168.5.151:8082/v1\nEmbeddings: http://voice-ai:8084/v1\nProduction webhook: http://192.168.5.151:5678/webhook/ivr-scenario-1\nIVR HTTPS webhook: https://192.168.5.151:8083/n8n/webhook/ivr-scenario-1\ndocker compose up -d --build automatically imports the local credentials and workflow after owner-account setup. Existing edits are preserved. Then publish. Use Test Scenario 1 to execute without a webhook; edit turn in Scenario 1 test input for turns 1–3. Expressions show runtime values after input is received."
